Acknowledgements
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Shadow Tweaks is an independent implementation written against Minecraft
1.21.11. No source code from any other project was copied or adapted.

The mod respects the vanilla "Entity Shadows" video setting as its top-level
gate, which is the same setting Sodium Extra exposes. With shadows disabled
there, Shadow Tweaks intentionally does nothing.
